<attribute name="version" nodeId="5ded3cef"></attribute>
<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="2a6b56bf">&lt;p&gt;
    Perform the following:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Investigate discrepancies between the expected regression test results and actual results
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Identify alternative ways of accomplishing the desired outcome of the test, (e.g.,&amp;nbsp;manual steps instead of
        automation)
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Identify configuration or development that could be worked on in the future if budget and time constraints allow
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Define, prioritize, and initiate&amp;nbsp;actions to resolve defects where necessary
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Agree on&amp;nbsp;the mitigation plan, specifying work-arounds that&amp;nbsp;would enable the system to go live even if all
        outstanding defects cannot be corrected before the go-live date
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Identify reporting that can monitor the status, progress, and resolution of the work-arounds in order to verify the
        mitigation plan is being followed
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Identify the severity and level of risk for each outstanding defect
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Verify outstanding defect count is within agreed limits to take go or no-go decision.
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="externalId" nodeId="e657cc7a"></attribute>
<attribute name="keyConsiderations" nodeId="d90c0d49"></attribute>
<attribute name="longPresentationName" nodeId="8fc8e544"></attribute>
<attribute name="purpose" nodeId="ba3a5c39">&lt;p&gt;
    To have a record of what defects remained un-resolved at the end of user acceptance testing (UAT), what the
    understanding was for business work-arounds and the agreements reached.&amp;nbsp; With this asset, stakeholder are made
    aware of:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        What solutions are available
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        What defects are in progress of being resolved
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        What may not be resolved before go-live
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        How they can handle the situations caused by un-fixed defects
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="alternatives" nodeId="21e1f263"></attribute>
